{"seq":2,"slug":"capable-to-promise-date","title":"可承诺交货期（CTP）推算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/atp-ctp-compute/capable-to-promise-date","wordCount":3001,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"可承诺交货期-ctp-推算\">可承诺交货期（CTP）推算</h1><p>ATP 回答「还能承诺多少」，CTP（Capable-to-Promise）回答「哪天能到」。这一篇是承诺引擎的计算内核：把第一章准备的三类数据——日历、截单与处理时长、在途时长——沿时间轴依次应用，折出一个对外的承诺日期。</p>\n<p>推算本身不复杂，复杂的是<strong>在哪个分位数上折、什么时候用保守值、以及如何让结果可解释</strong>。这一篇把这三件事讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-推算是一条时间轴的串行推进\">核心概念：推算是一条时间轴的串行推进</h2><p>CTP 的基本形式是一条单向推进的时间轴，每一步消费一个已建模的时长或一个日历约束：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>handover</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>nextServiceDay</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>batchDate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>order</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mtext>ProcessingHours</mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{handover}} = \\text{nextServiceDay}\\big(\\text{batchDate}(t_{\\text{order}})\\big) \\oplus \\text{ProcessingHours}_{q_p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nextServiceDay</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">batchDate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">order</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1248em;vertical-align:-0.4415em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ProcessingHours</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4415em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>delivered</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>handover</mtext></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mtext>TransitWorkDays</mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{delivered}} = t_{\\text{handover}} \\oplus \\text{TransitWorkDays}_{q_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delivered</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TransitWorkDays</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊕</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span></span></span></span></span> 表示「按日历推进」（不是简单加法，见 <a href=\"../promise-data-calendar/warehouse-carrier-calendar\">仓库/承运商工作日与节假日日历</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是处理时长与在途时长所取的分位数。最终对外承诺的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>delivered</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{delivered}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">delivered</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 所落的<strong>日期</strong>（纯日期，不带时区）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    T[&quot;订单时刻 t_order&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;批次判定&lt;br/&gt;batchDate&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; P[&quot;叠加处理时长&lt;br/&gt;P50 用于内推&lt;br/&gt;P90 用于对外&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; H[&quot;预计交运 handoverTime&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; C1{&quot;仓库日历&lt;br/&gt;服务日?&quot;}&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2{&quot;承运商揽收&lt;br/&gt;服务日?&quot;}&#10;    C2 --&gt; TR[&quot;叠加在途时长&lt;br/&gt;TransitWorkDays_q&quot;]&#10;    TR --&gt; C3{&quot;目的国派送&lt;br/&gt;服务日?&quot;}&#10;    C3 --&gt; V[&quot;候选到达日&lt;br/&gt;candidateDate&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; S[&quot;按口径折出&lt;br/&gt;promiseDate&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; OUT[&quot;承诺日 + 承诺窗口&quot;]\">graph TD\n    T[\"订单时刻 t_order\"] --&gt; B[\"批次判定&lt;br/&gt;batchDate\"]\n    B --&gt; P[\"叠加处理时长&lt;br/&gt;P50 用于内推&lt;br/&gt;P90 用于对外\"]\n    P --&gt; H[\"预计交运 handoverTime\"]\n    H --&gt; C1{\"仓库日历&lt;br/&gt;服务日?\"}\n    C1 --&gt; C2{\"承运商揽收&lt;br/&gt;服务日?\"}\n    C2 --&gt; TR[\"叠加在途时长&lt;br/&gt;TransitWorkDays_q\"]\n    TR --&gt; C3{\"目的国派送&lt;br/&gt;服务日?\"}\n    C3 --&gt; V[\"候选到达日&lt;br/&gt;candidateDate\"]\n    V --&gt; S[\"按口径折出&lt;br/&gt;promiseDate\"]\n    S --&gt; OUT[\"承诺日 + 承诺窗口\"]</pre><p>这张图里有两处容易被忽略的分支。<strong>第一处是 <code>P50 用于内推 / P90 用于对外</code></strong>：内部推算用中位数可以给出「正常情况的到达日」，用于生成解释文案和内部排产参考；对外承诺必须用高分位。混用这两个会导致文案与承诺日打脸。<strong>第二处是最后一步的 <code>按口径折出</code></strong>——候选到达日与承诺日不是同一个东西，中间隔着一个商业选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分位数口径-最早可能-vs-大概率到达\">分位数口径：最早可能 vs 大概率到达</h2><p>承诺应该按「最早可能到达」还是按「大概率能到达」给出？这不是技术问题，但它决定了整个引擎的参数选择。</p>\n<p><strong>按最早可能（乐观口径）</strong>：承诺日取 P50 或更低的到达日。优点是承诺日期好看、转化率高；缺点是约一半的订单会超过它，违约率高达 30%-50%，客诉与赔付会把转化的收益吃掉。</p>\n<p><strong>按大概率到达（保守口径）</strong>：承诺日取 P90 或 P95。优点是违约率可控（5%-10%）；缺点是承诺日期比用户预期晚，在同质竞争中吃亏。</p>\n<p><strong>折中口径</strong>（实践中最多）：外对承诺取 P90，但<strong>同时展示一个区间</strong>（「10 月 3-5 日」），并把区间的下界取 P50、上界取 P95。这样既给了用户一个好看的乐观值，又不承诺它；结账页则收起区间，只保留上界作为契约。区间表达的一致性规则见 <a href=\"../promise-presentation/promise-cart-checkout-display\">购物车/结账/详情页承诺展示</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>承诺分位</th>\n<th>理论违约率</th>\n<th>转化影响</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>乐观</td>\n<td>P50</td>\n<td>~50%</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>低客诉成本、无赔付承诺的商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中庸</td>\n<td>P75-P80</td>\n<td>~20-25%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>一般品类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保守</td>\n<td>P90</td>\n<td>~10%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>有赔付承诺、高客单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极保守</td>\n<td>P95</td>\n<td>~5%</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>新线路、数据不足期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的「新线路、数据不足期」值得单独说。当某条线路的实测样本量低于阈值时，模型不确定度高，此时应当使用更保守的口径并<strong>标记该承诺为低置信</strong>，而不是套用高置信线路的参数。低置信承诺应当在展示层被区别对待（例如只展示区间不展示单日），并进入一个「加速学习」名单——主动采集、优先校准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分位数不可加的后果\">分位数不可加的后果</h3><p>如果处理时长取 P90、在途时长也取 P90，直接相加得到的日期的真实违约率<strong>低于</strong> 10%（两段同时落在 90 分位之后是小概率事件）。这意味着简单相加是<strong>安全的</strong>（不会导致违约率超标），但代价是承诺偏保守。</p>\n<p>精确的整链路分位数需要对分布做卷积，或者直接学习端到端分布。三种做法的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>违约率准确性</th>\n<th>分段诊断能力</th>\n<th>实现成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分段分位相加</td>\n<td>偏差（偏保守）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段分布卷积</td>\n<td>准确（需独立假设）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端分位学习</td>\n<td>准确</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的推荐组合是<strong>用端到端分布定承诺、用分段分布做解释</strong>。端到端分布从「下单时刻 → 签收时刻」的全链路数据学习，天然包含了段间相关性与所有未建模的环节；分段分布不参与承诺日的计算，但用于回答「这次为什么晚」这个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺窗口与日期区间的生成\">承诺窗口与日期区间的生成</h2><h3 id=\"窗口的计算与退化\">窗口的计算与退化</h3><p>单一日期对用户的确定感强，但信息量低；区间更诚实，但在移动端小屏上可能被截断。承诺窗口的生成方式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>early</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\,d_{\\text{early}},\\ d_{\\text{late}}\\,] = \\big[\\,F^{-1}(0.5),\\ F^{-1}(0.95)\\,\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">early</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>承诺契约日取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{late}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>early</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>late</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{\\text{early}} = d_{\\text{late}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">early</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">late</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时（分布足够窄，例如同城次日达），退化为单一日期展示，这是最理想的情况。当区间宽度超过某个阈值（例如 7 天），说明模型不确定度过高，应当考虑<strong>换一条线路或换一个仓</strong>，而不是展示一个宽到没有意义的区间——这也是多仓选路的一个决策输入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"区间宽度作为早期信号\">区间宽度作为早期信号</h3><p>区间宽度本身应作为监控指标：某条线路的区间宽度持续扩大，意味着这条线路的时长分布正在变胖，通常先于违约率上升出现，因此是一个有用的早期信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可解释性-承诺是怎么算出来的\">可解释性：承诺是怎么算出来的</h2><h3 id=\"快照的字段职责\">快照的字段职责</h3><p>承诺引擎必须具备<strong>逐段解释</strong>能力，原因很实际：客服每天都要回答「为什么承诺 5 天结果是 8 天」。没有分段归因，客服只能给一个模糊的答复，而这本身会放大客诉。</p>\n<p>解释的载体是承诺计算过程中的一份中间结果快照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;traceId&quot;: &quot;pcs-9f3a2c81&quot;,&#10;  &quot;input&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;orderPlacedUtc&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T03:41:12Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;warehouse&quot;: &quot;CN-SH-01&quot;,&#10;    &quot;carrier&quot;: &quot;CARRIER_A&quot;,&#10;    &quot;serviceLevel&quot;: &quot;standard&quot;,&#10;    &quot;destinationCountry&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;    &quot;destinationPostal&quot;: &quot;900**&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;steps&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;step&quot;: &quot;batch&quot;, &quot;result&quot;: &quot;2026-09-28&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;下单 11:41 本地时间晚于周六截单 12:00 前的上一服务日，顺延&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;step&quot;: &quot;processing&quot;,&#10;      &quot;hours&quot;: 14.0,&#10;      &quot;unit&quot;: &quot;working_hours&quot;,&#10;      &quot;quantile&quot;: &quot;p90&quot;,&#10;      &quot;handoverTimeLocal&quot;: &quot;2026-09-29T10:00:00&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    { &quot;step&quot;: &quot;transit&quot;, &quot;workDays&quot;: 8, &quot;quantile&quot;: &quot;p90&quot;, &quot;laneKey&quot;: &quot;CN-SH-01&gt;US-WEST&gt;CARRIER_A&gt;standard&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;step&quot;: &quot;deliveryCalendar&quot;, &quot;adjustment&quot;: &quot;+1&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;到达日为目的国周日，派送顺延&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;output&quot;: { &quot;promiseDate&quot;: &quot;2026-10-07&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: [&quot;2026-10-03&quot;, &quot;2026-10-07&quot;] },&#10;  &quot;versions&quot;: { &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;2026.09.4&quot;, &quot;processing&quot;: &quot;proc-v37&quot;, &quot;transit&quot;: &quot;transit-v61&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"traceId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pcs-9f3a2c81\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"input\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"orderPlacedUtc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T03:41:12Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"warehouse\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-SH-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"carrier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CARRIER_A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"serviceLevel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"destinationCountry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"destinationPostal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"900**\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-28\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"下单 11:41 本地时间晚于周六截单 12:00 前的上一服务日，顺延\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"processing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"working_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quantile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"handoverTimeLocal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-29T10:00:00\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"workDays\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"quantile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"p90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"laneKey\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-SH-01>US-WEST>CARRIER_A>standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deliveryCalendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"adjustment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"+1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"到达日为目的国周日，派送顺延\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"output\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"promiseDate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-07\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-03\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-07\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"versions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.09.4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"processing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"proc-v37\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"transit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transit-v61\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个字段承担了不同的职责。<code>reason</code> 让每一步<strong>可朗读</strong>——客服可以直接把「到达日是周日所以顺延一天」念给用户。<code>versions</code> 让结果<strong>可复现</strong>——所有模型版本都记录在案，事后重算能得到同一个答案（这正是日历必须版本化的原因，见 <a href=\"../promise-data-calendar/warehouse-carrier-calendar\">仓库/承运商工作日与节假日日历</a>）。<code>window</code> 与 <code>promiseDate</code> 同时保留，让展示层可以按场景选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"冷存全量-热存采样\">冷存全量、热存采样</h3><p>这份快照不应全量持久化（存储成本高），推荐策略是：<strong>冷存全量、热存采样</strong>。所有承诺快照写入列式存储或对象存储用于事后分析；同时在订单上保留一份精简版（承诺日 + 各段版本号），用于客服实时查询与违约归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ctp-计算的性能设计\">CTP 计算的性能设计</h2><h3 id=\"推算零-io-与模型热替换\">推算零 IO 与模型热替换</h3><p>CTP 是购前链路的一部分，它被商品详情页、购物车、结账页共同调用，QPS 与页面浏览量同级。性能上有三条必须守住的红线。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，推算本身必须是无 IO 的纯计算。</strong> 日历、时长分布、桶边界都应当在进程内缓存，推算过程中不查数据库、不调外部服务。这要求所有模型数据支持<strong>整块热替换</strong>：新版本加载完成后原子切换指针，进行中的请求继续用旧版本，避免锁竞争与请求抖动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"批量去重与结果缓存\">批量去重与结果缓存</h3><p><strong>第二，批量与去重。</strong> 详情页一次请求可能包含多个 SKU，购物车包含多个商品行。必须支持批量推算（一次请求算 N 个组合），并在内部对相同的 <code>(warehouse, carrier, lane, promiseDate)</code> 组合去重——同一个页面上多个商品往往共享同一条线路参数。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，缓存承诺结果而非输入。</strong> 承诺结果对 <code>(sku, destination, serviceLevel, 时间桶)</code> 是可以缓存的，缓存键里必须包含<strong>时间桶</strong>（例如按 5 分钟分桶）而不是精确时刻，否则缓存命中率趋近于零。TTL 应设得短（例如 5-15 分钟），因为承诺的价值恰恰在于对变化的敏感性。这里有一个权衡：缓存太久会让承诺在运力变化后仍显示旧值，缓存太短会失去全部收益。推荐的折中是短 TTL 加上<strong>主动失效</strong>——当某条线路的时长模型或日历发生重要变更时，主动清空相关缓存键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE promise_cache_entry (&#10;  cache_key        CHAR(64)     NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id           BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  warehouse_id     INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  dest_region      VARCHAR(24)  NOT NULL,&#10;  service_level    VARCHAR(32)  NOT NULL,&#10;  time_bucket      DATETIME     NOT NULL,&#10;  promise_date     DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  window_from      DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  window_to        DATE         NOT NULL,&#10;  confidence       ENUM(&#39;high&#39;,&#39;medium&#39;,&#39;low&#39;) NOT NULL,&#10;  trace_id         VARCHAR(40)  NOT NULL,&#10;  expires_at_utc   DATETIME     NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (cache_key),&#10;  KEY idx_invalidate (warehouse_id, dest_region, service_level, time_bucket)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> promise_cache_entry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cache_key        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dest_region      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  service_level    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  time_bucket      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  promise_date     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_from      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_to        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence       ENUM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trace_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at_utc   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cache_key),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_invalidate (warehouse_id, dest_region, service_level, time_bucket)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>idx_invalidate</code> 存在的唯一目的是支持主动失效：当日历或时长模型变更时，按 <code>(warehouse_id, dest_region, service_level)</code> 批量删除受影响的行，而不是清空整表。<code>confidence</code> 字段让降级与低置信的承诺能被区别对待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界条件与退化\">边界条件与退化</h2><h3 id=\"四类容易漏掉的边界\">四类容易漏掉的边界</h3><p>推算的边界条件比主路径更容易出错，因为它不常发生，往往在第一次遇到时才被发现。</p>\n<p><strong>跨年与跨月。</strong> 承诺日跨年时，任何用「年内第几天」做键的缓存或分桶逻辑都会出错；工作日推算中的节假日表也要覆盖次年的数据。检查方式是：日历表永远保持至少 13 个月的前瞻数据，并在不足 12 个月时告警。</p>\n<p><strong>极长承诺期。</strong> 预售商品的承诺日可能落在 3 个月之后，此时在途时长的分布已经完全不可靠（模型的数据窗口远短于承诺期）。正确做法是把这类承诺标记为「预计送达时间」，与普通承诺区分，并在临近时刷新——而不是假装知道 3 个月后的分布。</p>\n<p><strong>无可用线路。</strong> 当所有仓/承运商组合都算不出结果时（例如目的国禁运、承运商停收），引擎必须返回一个明确的「不可承诺」信号，而不是一个兜底的超长日期。两者在展示层的处理完全不同：前者会引导用户留下邮箱等待到货通知，后者会让用户看到一个「90 天后送达」的荒诞承诺。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时钟依赖必须显式传入\">时钟依赖必须显式传入</h3><p><strong>时钟与时间桶边界。</strong> 缓存键的时间桶按 5 分钟切分时，桶边界附近的并发请求可能计算出不同结果（因为输入相同，结果应相同——前提是模型中没有任何依赖「当前时刻」的项）。必须确保推算函数对「当前时刻」的依赖只通过显式传入的参数发生，否则同一桶内的请求会得到不同答案，这是最难排查的一类不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CTP 是一条单向推进的时间轴：批次判定 → 处理时长 → 交运 → 在途时长 → 派送日历，每一步都按日历推进而非简单加法。</li>\n<li>对外承诺取 P90 一类的高分位，内部推算可用 P50；两者混用会导致文案与承诺日打脸。</li>\n<li>承诺窗口取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[F^{-1}(0.5), F^{-1}(0.95)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>，契约日取上界；区间宽度本身是线路退化的一级监控信号。</li>\n<li>分段分位相加是安全的（偏保守）但不精确；推荐用端到端分布定承诺、用分段分布做解释归因。</li>\n<li>可解释性是产品要求而非可选项：逐段快照带 <code>reason</code> 与 <code>versions</code>，冷存全量、热存采样。</li>\n<li>性能三条红线：推算过程零 IO、支持批量与组合去重、缓存承诺结果（键含时间桶）并支持按线路的主动失效。</li>\n<li>边界条件必须显式处理：跨年日历前瞻、超长承诺期的低置信标记、无可用线路时的明确「不可承诺」信号、以及推算函数不得隐式依赖当前时刻。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>单仓单承运商的情况下 CTP 到此结束。当候选组合变成多个仓与多家承运商的笛卡尔积时，问题从「算一个」变成「在一堆里选一个」。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可承诺交货期（CTP）推算","id":"可承诺交货期-ctp-推算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：推算是一条时间轴的串行推进","id":"核心概念-推算是一条时间轴的串行推进"},{"level":2,"text":"分位数口径：最早可能 vs 大概率到达","id":"分位数口径-最早可能-vs-大概率到达"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数不可加的后果","id":"分位数不可加的后果"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺窗口与日期区间的生成","id":"承诺窗口与日期区间的生成"},{"level":3,"text":"窗口的计算与退化","id":"窗口的计算与退化"},{"level":3,"text":"区间宽度作为早期信号","id":"区间宽度作为早期信号"},{"level":2,"text":"可解释性：承诺是怎么算出来的","id":"可解释性-承诺是怎么算出来的"},{"level":3,"text":"快照的字段职责","id":"快照的字段职责"},{"level":3,"text":"冷存全量、热存采样","id":"冷存全量-热存采样"},{"level":2,"text":"CTP 计算的性能设计","id":"ctp-计算的性能设计"},{"level":3,"text":"推算零 IO 与模型热替换","id":"推算零-io-与模型热替换"},{"level":3,"text":"批量去重与结果缓存","id":"批量去重与结果缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"边界条件与退化","id":"边界条件与退化"},{"level":3,"text":"四类容易漏掉的边界","id":"四类容易漏掉的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"时钟依赖必须显式传入","id":"时钟依赖必须显式传入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可承诺量（ATP）计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/atp-ctp-compute/available-to-promise"},"next":{"title":"多仓多承运选路求最早/最低成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/delivery-promise-engine/atp-ctp-compute/multi-node-promise-optimize"}}